"Timer 在 OC / Swift 侧只是语言不同：OC 侧 JobsOCTimer、Swift 侧 JobsSwiftTimer，都是把系统 Timer / GCD / DisplayLink / RunLoop 的杂乱细节收口成少量参数。\\n\\n应用层副产物应该归到 Timer 体系下，例如倒计时按钮、时钟、红包雨、抽奖轮盘、跑马灯和轮播图。\\n\\nTimerMgr 是多个 Timer 的统一注册表：OC 侧 JobsOCTimerMgr、Swift 侧 JobsSwiftTimerMgr，都按 identifier 管理 start / pause / resume / stop。\\n\\nJobsMarqueeView 用 JobsOCTimerMgr 做统一内核，把跑马灯和轮播图收口成同一个 UIScrollView + UIButton 数据源组件。" = "Magkaiba lang ng wika ang Timer sa OC / Swift side: ang JobsOCTimer sa OC at JobsSwiftTimer sa Swift ay parehong nagbabalot ng magulong detalye ng system Timer / GCD / DisplayLink / RunLoop sa kaunting parameter.\\n\\nDapat mapabilang sa Timer system ang application-layer derivatives, gaya ng countdown buttons, clocks, red packet rain, lucky wheels, marquees, at carousels.\\n\\nAng TimerMgr ay registry para sa maraming timer: pareho nitong pinamamahalaan ang start / pause / resume / stop ayon sa identifier sa OC JobsOCTimerMgr at Swift JobsSwiftTimerMgr.\\n\\nGinagamit ng JobsMarqueeView ang JobsOCTimerMgr bilang unified core, kaya ang marquee at carousel ay nagiging iisang UIScrollView + UIButton data-source component.";
